{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 3 x Superscript 5\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math>. In the <em>xy</em>-plane, the graph of <math alttext=\"y equals g left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is the result of shifting the graph of <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> up <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math> units. Which equation defines the function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math>?</p>", "keys": ["2f606b64-2607-4612-8785-145c162afcb4"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "2f606b64-2607-4612-8785-145c162afcb4", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 3 x Superscript 5 Baseline plus 4\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></math></p>"}, {"id": "fba34e20-d79c-423e-a3bb-0341a78dab3f", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 3 x Superscript 5 Baseline minus 4\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></math></p>"}, {"id": "8a84a240-d1af-4b97-a5e4-23a7e0d650a7", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 3 x Superscript 20\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"}, {"id": "26c8cbd2-4f42-4782-8e49-d533d0bf05ef", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 12 x Superscript 5\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is correct. It's given that in the <em>xy</em>-plane, the graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals g left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is the result of shifting the graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> up&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn></math> units. It follows that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis plus 4\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math>. It's also given that function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi></math> is defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 3 x Superscript 5\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math>. Substituting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"3 x Superscript 5\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math> for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> into&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis plus 4\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math> yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 3 x Superscript 5 Baseline plus 4\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math>. Therefore, the equation that defines function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 3 x Superscript 5 Baseline plus 4\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This equation defines a function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi></math> for which the graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals g left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is the result of shifting the graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> down, not up,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn></math> units.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>", "externalid": "1cfbd034-f610-4c8e-8e6f-88944150668f", "correct_answer": ["A"]}